// pfodWeb NOTE: excludes GPIO0 - dedicated onboard MPU9250 IMU
// interrupt line, not general-purpose.
// pfodWeb NOTE: GPIO4 tagged "led_neopixel" - confirmed 25 WS2812 addressable
